        {
          "sid": "friends-t1-s01",
          "c": "我哋約星期六食飯。",
          "j": "ngo5 dei6 joek3 sing1 kei4 luk6 sik6 faan6.",
          "e": "We're meeting for lunch on Saturday.",
          "note": "哋 (dei6) makes pronouns plural — 我哋 (ngo5 dei6) \"we\", 你哋 (nei5 dei6) \"you (pl.)\", 佢哋 (keoi5 dei6) \"they\". 約 (joek3) means \"to arrange / make a plan to meet\" — 約食飯 (joek3 sik6 faan6) \"arrange a meal\".",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "我哋",
              "j": "ngo5 dei6",
              "e": "we"
            },
            {
              "c": "約",
              "j": "joek3",
              "e": "made plans"
            },
            {
              "c": "星期六",
              "j": "sing1 kei4 luk6",
              "e": "Saturday"
            },
            {
              "c": "食飯",
              "j": "sik6 faan6",
              "e": "eat / have a meal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
