            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "friends-t1-s04",
          "c": "對唔住，改日啦。",
          "j": "deoi3 m4 zyu6, goi2 jat6 laa1.",
          "e": "Sorry, another day.",
          "note": "改日 (goi2 jat6), literally \"change day\", is a polite \"some other day\" — the gentle way to postpone. 對唔住，改日啦 (deoi3 m4 zyu6, goi2 jat6 laa1) \"sorry, another time\".",
