        {
          "sid": "friends-t2-s06",
          "c": "佢係我嘅同學，而且而家仲係同事。",
          "j": "keoi5 hai6 ngo5 ge3 tung4 hok6, ji4 ce2 ji4 gaa1 zung6 hai6 tung4 si6.",
          "e": "She is my classmate, and now she is also my colleague.",
          "note": "同學 (tung4 hok6) \"classmate\" and <b>同事</b> (tung4 si6) \"colleague\" share 同 (tung4) \"same\" — the person you share school or work with. Easy to remember as a pair.",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "佢",
              "j": "keoi5",
              "e": "she"
            },
            {
              "c": "係",
              "j": "hai6",
              "e": "is"
            },
            {
              "c": "我嘅同學",
              "j": "ngo5 ge3 tung4 hok6",
              "e": "my classmate"
            },
            {
              "c": "而且",
              "j": "ji4 ce2",
              "e": "moreover"
            },
            {
              "c": "而家",
              "j": "ji4 gaa1",
              "e": "now"
            },
            {
              "c": "仲係",
              "j": "zung6 hai6",
              "e": "also is"
            },
            {
              "c": "同事",
              "j": "tung4 si6",
              "e": "colleague"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "friends-t2-s07",
          "c": "因為我哋好夾，所以成日一齊出街。",
          "j": "jan1 wai6 ngo5 dei6 hou2 gaap3, so2 ji5 sing4 jat6 jat1 cai4 ceot1 gaai1.",
          "e": "Because we really click, we always hang out together.",
          "note": "<b>夾</b> (gaap3) \"click / get along\" — a distinctively Cantonese word for natural chemistry between people. 好夾 (hou2 gaap3) \"we really click\"; 唔夾 (m4 gaap3) \"we don't really get on\". Hard to translate directly.",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "因為",
              "j": "jan1 wai6",
              "e": "because"
            },
            {
              "c": "我哋",
              "j": "ngo5 dei6",
